    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "### Motivation\n- Establish a governance-first repository layout and automation scaffold for research-only signal discovery and controlled self-improvement. \n- Enforce safety constraints (no live trading, no auto-merge, branch-based automation) and provide auditable, append-only artifacts for proposals, approvals, and simulations. \n- Provide structured schemas and registries so proposals, evidence scorecards, and candidate signals can be validated and traced. \n- Add an alerts watcher to surface research-only market conditions and persist run history for audit. \n\n### Description\n- Add multiple GitHub Actions workflows including `draft-pr-generator`, `feedback-ingest`, `perp-research-alerts`, `repo-self-review`, `simulation-validation`, and `weekly-evolution-report` to automate feedback ingestion, draft PR creation, self-review, schema validation, simulation placeholders, and scheduled reports. \n- Introduce JSON Schema definitions under `docs/schemas/` (`improvement_proposal.schema.json`, `candidate_signal.schema.json`, `evidence_scorecard.schema.json`) and a large set of governance and design docs (`docs/REDESIGN_PLAN.md`, `DATA_SCHEMAS.md`, `RESEARCH_LAB_REDESIGN.md`, etc.). \n- Add core repository artifacts and append-only registries and examples including `improvement_proposals/`, `experiments/`, `approvals/`, `candidate_signal_registry/`, `registries/active_config.json`, `dashboards/metrics_snapshot.json`, and starter entries such as proposals, simulations, evidence, and hypothesis history. \n- Add a research-only watcher script `scripts/perp_research_alerts.py` that polls public endpoints (Binance/Gate), writes history snapshots, and creates/updates GitHub issues labeled `research-alert`. \n- Update `README.md` to reflect the governance-first, research-only mission and add numerous README placeholders across components (feature/hypothesis/evaluation engines, memory store, etc.). \n\n### Testing\n- No automated tests were executed as part of this PR. \n- CI workflows were added to run schema checks via `simulation-validation` (uses `python -m json.tool` against schema files) when triggered. \n- The `feedback-ingest` job produces `feedback_ingest/classified_feedback.json` and uploads it as an artifact when run. \n- The `perp-research-alerts` workflow runs `scripts/perp_research_alerts.py` and uploads `alerts/history/*.json` snapshots when triggered.\n\n------\n[Codex Task](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/tasks/task_e_69e07bc14bc083219c84298cf0086439)",
